{"2026.6.13:P03-Q05":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>实验过程对应的离子方程式</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.6.13 · 周南联校 · 第5题 · P03-Q05</div><h1>实验过程对应的离子方程式</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：认识化学科学/离子反应/离子反应及离子方程式/离子方程式的书写</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：考查物质拆写、配位反应及弱酸性质对离子反应的影响。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃的衍生物/酚类</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/盐类的水解/盐类水解原理</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量H 1  Li 7  C 12  O 16  Fe 56  Br 80  Cs 133  Pb 207</p><p>5. 下列过程中，对应的离子方程式正确的是</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>A</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>向<img src=\"chem-asset:72e6b065294b81db552af9b11190ef099fb22ebf9615b88405973ccfe2492e0b:0;\" style=\"width:44.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液中加入少量<img src=\"chem-asset:6917385cdf924efa369f57a224f2a3babb9f92206895cd4d1a8c91824e8cf10e:1;\" style=\"width:40.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">固体，搅拌后蓝色溶液变成黄绿色溶液</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:412e82295a2611fa69c6834b60759f6ed0a1c7d6bc8ec246ac69be68b87ed065:2;\" style=\"width:288.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>B</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>用过量的热烧碱溶液检验<img src=\"chem-asset:eb7fa366abc9430bc53a4661a47e5856e6c497f17e411610c7160f61078862b5:3;\" style=\"width:72.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中的<img src=\"chem-asset:76e3739a954b0219c881f95741946fea3b6f033be88ed4b3c5c890becd5adf82:4;\" style=\"width:35.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:f768ccd895b6e93ab9d617d401ac93e68bc1fddad7a74ed3789fe90bef72c8ba:5;\" style=\"width:181.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>C</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:9ac9eb12b27feea79ce09d2f8e8ad1db683fb284d986883c95db5a148ea7df14:6;\" style=\"width:24.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">通入石灰乳中</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:c12e573fddf119655a72ec5d64979c8d97441ad686e9415939227f745e6b2879:7;\" style=\"width:211.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>D</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>向<img src=\"chem-asset:6a7ce9cf7b109051e41d0ac00529f4434a20a33f2ebd8ab10bc42dc66b2d790a:8;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液中滴加苯酚溶液</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:faf5cca5422a0da5056de59c6b53fe7d7136ecb63d2623166f5f931363119795:9;\" style=\"width:338.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td></tr></table></div><p>A. A　B. B　C. C　D. D</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】A</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．<img src=\"chem-asset:b18d2e76bec7a668ab9f42304f8c1857cac9b93d3c99c6564bd7b39a6b65192d:10;\" style=\"width:36.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">在水溶液中以水合离子<img src=\"chem-asset:c2357233386aae03adcf5a90c850dccdb7bf759a85ad8c2e8de17488d002f7be:11;\" style=\"width:100.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">形式存在，呈蓝色，加入<img src=\"chem-asset:010beac679d23fa06174c2695a7c8f42edaa4ad589e530904290c077eef69e7f:12;\" style=\"width:25.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">后，发生络合反应<img src=\"chem-asset:738d01f16cfc6a75613c78d944b16fd6109b93c57e46b9fa86826830c1667700:13;\" style=\"width:289.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，生成黄绿色的<img src=\"chem-asset:3d0fb200933f4255b01dfbbb56936516905969b41823f0f94504ac36ae76d214:14;\" style=\"width:67.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，离子方程式正确，A正确；</p><p>B．<img src=\"chem-asset:8859b412857abee577091f396272064e8ca95d0d9705fbb6f3d9cb786f50954c:15;\" style=\"width:71.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">在水溶液中完全电离为<img src=\"chem-asset:aa97bdaeb3889015c43eff881a5909d8a4ea15a1f2b0846b143900d9507d97d1:16;\" style=\"width:117.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:736a68f31cd7c8343fad3696f99a1f3d4a3b25843edcc39386b93b9b34d3e230:17;\" style=\"width:69.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">均会与过量的<img src=\"chem-asset:5351c8bd1402144145562ba64d52b39c4603f61d721ec47582753555115a3297:18;\" style=\"width:34.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">反应，离子方程式应为<img src=\"chem-asset:2fd431c33890f2529f88b0047f7aad3723a63fa7a052876ef5bf70d92b6ef4c4:19;\" style=\"width:235.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，B错误；</p><p>C．石灰乳是<img src=\"chem-asset:37db8bc0e6366fe2a74d8d3bf1253bdb37deda9b8696d1c266c676f38283dbeb:20;\" style=\"width:67.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">悬浊液，不能拆，离子方程式应为<img src=\"chem-asset:bce45e2fa7031b4533c44bdf35dcf68a1fa81296082fd9e135019d1c655d5558:21;\" style=\"width:287.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，C错误；</p><p>D．苯酚酸性比碳酸弱，向<img src=\"chem-asset:6a7ce9cf7b109051e41d0ac00529f4434a20a33f2ebd8ab10bc42dc66b2d790a:8;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液中滴加苯酚溶液，两者不发生反应，不能得到<img src=\"chem-asset:1475667f7090075e3b123ec6b4e0ef1ed7fb5d41ac209d700f21928931fc9bbf:22;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，D错误；</p><p>故选A。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">本页保存原卷答案与解析。知识点标签和分类依据为本次整理结果；未逐题独立重解或校订原解析。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>精品解析：湖南长沙市周南中学等校2026届高三下学期5月考前适应性训练 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><p class=\"source-path\">D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.6.13\\精品解析：湖南长沙市周南中学等校2026届高三下学期5月考前适应性训练 化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市周南中学等校2026届高三下学期5月考前适应性训练 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD